                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "95aacab9-6bef-4d9e-9e62-11039dadf23f",
                        "source_entry_id": "aeb290f5-2e80-3e97-be05-f5a028fe150e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba473b1f-ac67-35ae-b94f-e25a6e89fc1e",
                        "target_lang_word": "destruction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "destruction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1655afd-3fba-3942-8b7b-575cccedac61",
                                        "entry_id": "3260a78f-e26e-3b49-9506-2a1ed0b9375e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of destroying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2840b9-f2af-4db7-9ced-a7d5699dc729",
                                                "sense_id": "c1655afd-3fba-3942-8b7b-575cccedac61",
                                                "text": "The destruction of the condemned building will take place at noon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa3fc8a7-592f-4aa6-971b-02f7ed67f191",
                                                "sense_id": "c1655afd-3fba-3942-8b7b-575cccedac61",
                                                "text": "It may be that a free society as we have known it carries in itself the forces of its own destruction, that once freedom has been achieved it is taken for granted and ceases to be valued, and that the free growth of ideas which is the essence of a free society will bring about the destruction of the foundations on which it depends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "919585b2-bf88-4745-91ca-c6a9ed067ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "c1655afd-3fba-3942-8b7b-575cccedac61",
                                                "text": "About 1500 B.C., however, a powerful earthquake caused widespread destruction, and thereafter there were major changes. An earlier script, undeciphered, but known as Linear A, was replaced by the Greek Linear B."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63ddea86-b825-30dd-a211-227c5fe5ec06",
                                        "entry_id": "3260a78f-e26e-3b49-9506-2a1ed0b9375e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The results of a destructive event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78fd7c37-1092-48a2-b733-b4ce19fe90f7",
                                                "sense_id": "63ddea86-b825-30dd-a211-227c5fe5ec06",
                                                "text": "Amid the seemingly endless destruction, a single flower bloomed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68cf2d12-32a8-44fe-956d-2fc339b69457",
                                                "sense_id": "63ddea86-b825-30dd-a211-227c5fe5ec06",
                                                "text": "If destruction be our lot we must ourselves be its author and finisher. As a nation of freemen we must live through all time or die by suicide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f064b243-3a36-3f7d-87f9-e688d741fc2a",
                                        "entry_id": "3260a78f-e26e-3b49-9506-2a1ed0b9375e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of feral cats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb69c659-442b-40db-b854-1989f309279f",
                                                "sense_id": "f064b243-3a36-3f7d-87f9-e688d741fc2a",
                                                "text": "A group of wild cats is called a destruction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bcd74f89-7e96-41a7-b39e-a96e0f28fde2",
                        "source_entry_id": "aeb290f5-2e80-3e97-be05-f5a028fe150e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba473b1f-ac67-35ae-b94f-e25a6e89fc1e",
                        "target_lang_word": "destrukce",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "destrukce",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f97d96c4-9330-39fe-9c63-f6f6434fc086",
                                        "entry_id": "d84c85ca-1819-33de-b0d3-d803817b95ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "rozsáhlé narušení celistvosti či ukončení existence"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bd4d2e4-11a3-44dc-aa7f-cd465527b44a",
                                                "sense_id": "f97d96c4-9330-39fe-9c63-f6f6434fc086",
                                                "text": "Destrukce dané oblasti po potopě byla opravdu dechberoucí."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03a69bf6-f546-4090-a23c-33b649b04869",
                        "source_entry_id": "aeb290f5-2e80-3e97-be05-f5a028fe150e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba473b1f-ac67-35ae-b94f-e25a6e89fc1e",
                        "target_lang_word": "destruction",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "destruction",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                        "entry_id": "ac03c3e3-b098-3dda-b90e-7feea350e5c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de détruire, au propre et au figuré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "485a8fe1-fd88-470b-b73c-8bad4c750762",
                                                "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                                "text": "Par contre, en solution à 1 p. 100, l’arsénite de soude exerce des actions énergiques comme herbicide, herbifuge et insecticide. A la dose de 1/2 p. 100, il a été utilisé pour la destruction des criquets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "508dadcb-3c29-4d75-9f9a-b033ae2a00ae",
                                                "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                                "text": "On la dévasta, comme, au siècle précédent, on avait bombardé d’immenses agglomérations barbares, et parce qu’elle était à la fois trop forte pour être occupée par le vainqueur et trop indisciplinée, trop orgueilleuse pour se rendre dans le but d’échapper à la destruction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d79c1197-5bc6-4aea-8e46-20aff5011614",
                                                "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                                "text": "D’une manière générale, les femmes ménopausées sont les premières cibles de l’ostéoporose, en raison de la fin de la sécrétion osseuse, en raison de la fin de la sécrétion des œstrogènes, hormones qui empêchent la destruction osseuse par leur action frénatrice sur les ostéoclastes (ces cellules des os dont le rôle est à la fois de détruire l’os ancien et de le renouveler)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba28bd6c-cafd-4b6e-8d90-a87caea03dab",
                                                "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                                "text": "Ces lettres furent recueillies, Dieu sait comment, après la destruction quasi totale de Cologne par bombardements aériens […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7858c1ac-acc7-4841-b64b-c941d54717c4",
                                                "sense_id": "97d7fd25-b840-3124-8fbf-4ea8c7175bc2",
                                                "text": "D'après l'Insee, le chômage devrait continuer à progresser et atteindre 11% d'ici l'été, avec 75000 destructions supplémentaires d'emplois marchands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88e2a3a7-4a04-3b90-a956-cb5f90656107",
                                        "entry_id": "ac03c3e3-b098-3dda-b90e-7feea350e5c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui subsiste des objets après leur destruction partielle ou totale, par opposition à construction. (généralement employé au pluriel)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4cb446c-4731-4aa6-8d42-8f7ec4eda1b0",
                                                "sense_id": "88e2a3a7-4a04-3b90-a956-cb5f90656107",
                                                "text": "Les réfugiés tentent de s’installer au milieu de ces destructions qu’ils aménagent avec leur maigres moyens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9132bd19-05c0-4ad7-b9dd-c3dd6d12bca2",
                                                "sense_id": "88e2a3a7-4a04-3b90-a956-cb5f90656107",
                                                "text": "Dans ce paysage de désolation, on ne voyait plus que les destructions toutes de gravas et de poussière grise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
